@startuml
skinparam lifelineStrategy solid
autonumber
title Diagrama Devoluciones 5: POST /api/v1/refunds/:id/levels/1/item-selection (Selección de ítems y disociación)

actor "Analista CX (Nivel 1)" as Analyst
participant "App Web" as Web
participant "Gateway Controller" as Gateway
participant "Refund Workflow Service" as Service
participant "Transaction Manager\n(QueryRunner)" as TX
participant "refund_workflow_instance_levels DB" as LevelsDB
participant "refund_order_details DB" as DetailsDB
participant "refund_order_detail_decisions DB" as DecisionsDB
participant "refund_orders DB" as OrdersDB
participant "refund_workflow_instances DB" as InstanceDB
participant "refund_workflow_actions DB" as ActionsDB

Analyst -> Web: Marca qué líneas quedan en la nota y cuáles se disocian
Web -> Gateway: POST /api/v1/refunds/1001/levels/1/item-selection\n(Level1SelectionDto: { items: [{ detailId, decision }], comment })
Gateway -> Service: applyLevel1ItemSelection(refundOrderId: 1001, payload, actor)

Service -> LevelsDB: 1. findCurrentLevel(instanceId)
LevelsDB --> Service: level { id: 210, level_order: 1,\ndecision_mode: 'ITEM_SELECTION', status: 'IN_PROGRESS' }

Service -> Service: 2. assertSelectionAllowed(level, actor)
' note right of Service
'   409 si decision_mode != 'ITEM_SELECTION'
'   (solo el nivel 1 del PRIMER intento
'   selecciona; después nunca más hay casillas)
'   403 si actor.roleCode != level.role_code
'   422 si la selección no cubre todas las
'   líneas ACTIVE, o si deja cero seleccionadas
' end note

Service -> TX: 3. startTransaction()
activate TX

Service -> ActionsDB: 4. insertWorkflowAction(instanceId, 210, 'LEVEL1_ITEM_SELECTION')
ActionsDB --> Service: workflowActionId: 601

Service -> DecisionsDB: 5. insertDetailDecisions(601, payload.items)
note right of DecisionsDB
  Una fila por línea:
  decision = 'SELECTED' | 'DISSOCIATED'
  Es el registro binario del nivel 1
  y nada más.
end note
DecisionsDB --> Service: ok

alt Selección total (ninguna línea disociada)
    Service -> Service: 6. noSplitRequired()
    note right of Service
      La nota sigue de largo con su total
      intacto. No nace ninguna disociada.
    end note
else Selección parcial (al menos una línea disociada)
    Service -> DetailsDB: 7. markDetailsDissociated(dissociatedDetailIds)
    note right of DetailsDB
      UPDATE refund_order_details
      SET line_status = 'DISSOCIATED'
    end note
    DetailsDB --> Service: ok

    Service -> Service: 8. recomputeTotals(activeItems, dissociatedItems)
    note right of Service
      totalOriginal = SUM(ACTIVE)
      totalDisociada = SUM(DISSOCIATED)
    end note

    Service -> OrdersDB: 9. updateRefundOrderTotal(1001, totalOriginal)
    OrdersDB --> Service: ok

    Service -> OrdersDB: 10. insertDissociatedRefundOrder(source: 1001, totalDisociada)
    note right of OrdersDB
      Nace la nota disociada:
      - note_number = el MISMO de la original
      - split_sequence = siguiente (1, 2…)
      - source_refund_order_id = 1001
      - document_type = 'DISSOCIATED'
      - status = 'OPEN'
      - mismo distributor_id, employee_id,
        owner_id, customer_id
    end note
    OrdersDB --> Service: dissociatedOrderId: 1004

    Service -> DetailsDB: 11. cloneDetailsIntoDissociated(1004, dissociatedDetailIds)
    note right of DetailsDB
      Por línea movida:
      - source_detail_id = línea de origen
      - source_quantity y quantity = la cantidad
        que traía (tope para el vendedor)
      - price_unit congelado sin cambios
      - line_status = 'ACTIVE'
    end note
    DetailsDB --> Service: ok

    Service -> InstanceDB: 12. insertWorkflowInstance(1004, attempt: 1, 'EDITING', currentLevelOrder: NULL)
    note right of InstanceDB
      La disociada NO entra en aprobación:
      arranca en EDITING, esperando que el
      vendedor corrija y la reenvíe.
    end note
    InstanceDB --> Service: dissociatedInstanceId: 56

    Service -> OrdersDB: 13. updateCurrentWorkflowInstance(1004, 56)
    OrdersDB --> Service: ok

    Service -> ActionsDB: 14. insertWorkflowAction(instanceId: 55, level: NULL, 'DISSOCIATED_CREATED')
    ActionsDB --> Service: ok
end

Service -> TX: 15. commitTransaction()
deactivate TX

Service --> Gateway: 200 OK (Level1SelectionResult:\n{ refundOrderId, total, dissociatedOrderId?, itemSelectionLocked: true })
Gateway --> Web: 200 OK
Web --> Analyst: Selección registrada • Las casillas no vuelven a mostrarse
@enduml
